{% comment %}
@description: Trang xac nhan sau khi dat hang thanh cong.
@required_substrings: {% layout "layout" %}, {% block content %}, {% endblock %}, order.id, order.items, order.total, order.customFields
@required_ids:
@notes: order co customerName/id/items[](name/quantity/price)/total/customerAddress/customerPhone/customFields. PHAI giu {% render "custom-fields", fields: order.customFields %} (hien field khach tu dien them luc checkout). Nhan them upsellProducts[] (san pham goi y dua tren cac san pham da mua trong don, xem services/productRecommendations.ts) - render qua components/product/related, tu an khi rong. Nhan them downloadableItems[] (name/href) - CHI co gia tri khi CartOrder.paymentStatus === 'paid' (dung nghia "thanh toan thanh cong" duy nhat xac thuc duoc trong he thong nay - cod/bank_transfer khong tu chuyen 'paid'), tu an khi rong; href da la link tai an toan qua routes/public/downloads.ts (KHONG can/duoc doi thanh URL khac).
{% endcomment %}

